@sldmn233/dsh-profile-share README · 3. Finish credentials：Open **首次配置**. Every detected requirement is listed as a secret, an environment variable, or a
login. Fill in your own values — the sender's keys were never in the code.

The page never shows a bare input box. Every item carries what the plugin can actually prove:

@sldmn233/dsh-profile-share README · 3. Finish credentials：- the provider's application page, matched from the environment variable name, the configured base
  URL, the row id or the bundle name (DeepSeek, 阿里云百炼, OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Moonshot,
  智谱, MiniMax, 硅基流动, OpenRouter, 火山方舟, Groq, WorkBuddy);
- a copyable `setx` / `export` command for environment variables, so the value does not depend on
  remembering the syntax;
- the field's own description from the plugin's config schema, when it documents itself.

@sldmn233/dsh-profile-share README · Bootstrap on a machine that does not have the plugin：Why the message instead of full automation: nothing in a bare DSH can recognise a `DSH-SHARE/1:`
string before the plugin that understands it is installed. A prefix detector in DSH core would
remove the message entirely; until then this two-line prompt is the seam.

@sldmn233/dsh-profile-share README · 分享码格式：分享码是 `gzip(JSON)` 的 base64url 编码，前缀 `DSH-SHARE/1:`。版本号会被校验：格式不兼容的码会
直接报错，而不是应用一半。载荷包含所选 bundle（名称、版本、安装 spec、启用状态）、每个配置行的
显式覆盖层，以及发送方的 profile 名与 DSH 版本（供页头显示）。

@sldmn233/dsh-profile-share README · 与相近插件的区别：[`wbb316/dsh-profile-sync`](https://github.com/wbb316/dsh-profile-sync) 是**同一台机器上**
两个 profile 之间搬运插件集，并且刻意不安装任何东西。本插件面向机器之间、人之间的场景：分享码自
包含，由接收方的 DSH 自己完成安装与启用。两者是有意共存的。
